<title>PORTUGAL: Yield eases to 5.59 pct on Portugal 6-mth bills.</title>
<headline>Yield eases to 5.59 pct on Portugal 6-mth bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 5.5898 percent, from 5.9540 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 182-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Treasury placed 33.4 billion escudos, more than the 25 billion initially offered. The last such sale was on January 9.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
